Additional fidelity (beyond the 4 required parity items, no scope narrowing):
  - 3 data states implemented for the page context source as well: loading (ArchivedContextState.Loading),
    empty (ArchivedContextState.Empty), error (ArchivedContextState.Error -> retriable TsAlertBanner InfoBar). The
    inbox is never blank — InboxBody owns loading/empty/error/success for the notification list itself.
  - copyLink parity (web copyLink) -> PageContainer.CopyLink=true + CopyLinkText="teslasync://notifications/archived".
  - back-to-inbox action -> InboxRoute "notifications/inbox" (web Link to="/notifications/inbox").
  - a11y: AutomationProperties names on the page + back action; PageContainer/InboxBody carry their own peers; Group peer on the page.
  - PII-safe diagnostics: view.opened slug=ArchivedPage (no notification/VIN/vehicle/rule payload).

